  "body": "Throughout the document, I have not found anything that clearly states whether the when/then [API of fetch()](https://fetch.spec.whatwg.org/#fetch-api) is just defined as such for readability, or if fetch() requests are promises. I was also expecting to see the [request class](https://fetch.spec.whatwg.org/#request-class) extend some sort of thenable interface, but it looks like it's a standalone object.\n",
